/P 566 0 R
/T (Distributors associate each product with a code, which they usually share when they send it to your institution. This code is specific to the distributor and they will likely ask for it if you are asking them about a specific product. Therefore, it is important to keep track of their product codes in your spreadsheet.)
/E (Distributors associate each product with a code, which they usually share when they send it to your institution. This code is specific to the distributor and they will likely ask for it if you are asking them about a specific product. Therefore, it is important to keep track of their product codes in your spreadsheet.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
