/Title (Sustainability in dining can mean many things depending on how it is assessed. One way that UCB determines the sustainability of procurement practices is through annual reporting of plant-based spend. This is an important metric, because animal-based agriculture can have serious environmental costs. Animal agriculture is responsible for 14.5% of global greenhouse gas emissions1, which are an important contributor to global warming and biodiversity loss.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4314 0 R
/Next 4337 0 R
>>
endobj
