/Title (Distributors associate each product with a code, which they usually share when they send it to your institution. This code is specific to the distributor and they will likely ask for it if you are asking them about a specific product. Therefore, it is important to keep track of their product codes in your spreadsheet.)
/Dest [39 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4484 0 R
/First 4494 0 R
/Last 4494 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
4491 0 obj
<<
/Title (Your university will also assign each product with a unique ID, which is usually different from the product code that the distributor provided. This ID is important to look up products within your menu management software, and will be important when discussing products with internal procurement officials.)
/Dest [39 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4485 0 R
/Next 4492 0 R
>>
endobj
